Z||000001||Haze_Performance||09-25-2001||04:49 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Countach:<BR><B>Okay, I'm an idiot.  How do I get pics to show up?  I got one in my signature for a while, it's not working anymore.  Also, I tried posting more pics, and a link to my site, can't get anything to work.  Mainly concerned about pics.<BR>Thanks,<BR>John<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>You can't link pics from Geocities anymore. They put a stop to that. You'll have to download <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/pip.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/pip.html</A>  .<P>Follow the directions & you can upload pics again.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Good Luck<BR>-Haze  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">   <P><P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/smallindysig_copy.jpg">     .     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/smallredsig.jpg">     .     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fullstaff_1.gif"> <BR><I><B><FONT COLOR="red">Classic Fiero Owners</B></I></FONT> - <FONT COLOR="red"><A HREF="http://www.WS6Fiero.com" TARGET=_blank>Click Here</A></FONT>||||reg||10
